240
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:14,520
Perhaps the oddest part of the strange process here comes next.

241
00:17:16,280 --> 00:17:19,240
Whatever meat remains on the skulls must be removed.

242
00:17:22,640 --> 00:17:25,840
Since the task is even too exacting for the human hand,

243
00:17:26,500 --> 00:17:29,320
