277
00:19:04,381 --> 00:19:07,180
This skeleton alone would weigh about 600 pounds.

278
00:19:07,181 --> 00:19:09,860
So it's necessary to build these strong supports.

279
00:19:09,861 --> 00:19:11,660
And they're all done right here in our facility,

280
00:19:11,661 --> 00:19:14,160
and they're built by hand.

281
00:19:14,161 --> 00:19:17,200
The final effect of this meticulous handcraftsmanship

