314
00:21:04,901 --> 00:21:06,900
So if he bounces on two feet,

315
00:21:06,901 --> 00:21:09,900
you can see the flexion in the spring right in here.

316
00:21:09,901 --> 00:21:11,900
Okay, if he bounces on one foot,

317
00:21:11,901 --> 00:21:14,900
you can see how the spring loads a lot more.

