00:21:29,180 --> 00:21:32,580
Like a pogo stick, each stilt channels the weight of the user,

324
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:36,160
pushing down the spring and loading it with potential energy.

325
00:21:37,160 --> 00:21:41,660
As the spring recoils, it releases that energy and pushes the user up.

