The spring typically is made out of e-glass,

335
00:22:08,961 --> 00:22:10,460
which is kind of glass that they used to make

336
00:22:10,461 --> 00:22:11,560
old helicopter blades out of.

337
00:22:11,561 --> 00:22:13,220
It has a huge amount of pliability.

338
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:19,380
Jay says learning to run and jump on these weird kangaroo

339
00:22:19,381 --> 00:22:21,380
legs is easier than you might think.

