00:22:49,821 --> 00:22:51,780
And you just want to try to jump higher and higher,

352
00:22:51,880 --> 00:22:54,260
see what it can do, how high it can get.

353
00:22:54,460 --> 00:22:55,160
Go.

354
00:22:57,660 --> 00:22:58,360
Yeah.

