531
00:34:13,201 --> 00:34:15,640
Pull on these.

532
00:34:15,641 --> 00:34:16,640
We got fireballs.

533
00:34:20,380 --> 00:34:23,560
The snail car revels in its own oddness.

534
00:34:23,561 --> 00:34:25,060
What better reason for its number three

535
00:34:25,061 --> 00:34:26,060
