Our choice at number two is also odd,

537
00:34:30,861 --> 00:34:33,360
just for oddness' sake.

538
00:34:33,361 --> 00:34:36,240
But takes the bizarre to a whole new level.

539
00:34:36,241 --> 00:34:38,240
Brace yourself for the strange world

540
00:34:38,241 --> 00:34:40,580
of Marvin's Marvelous Mechanical Museum.

541
00:34:42,740 --> 00:34:44,800
Weird finds a truly new meaning

542
00:34:44,801 --> 00:34:47,560
at this unique arcade in Farmington Hills, Michigan.

543
00:34:48,480 --> 00:34:49,960
Welcome to Marvin's,

544
00:34:49,961 --> 00:34:52,860
known from coast to coast like butter and toast.

545
00:34:52,861 --> 00:34:54,740
Nowhere in the contiguous United States

546
00:34:54,741 --> 00:34:57,380
or other environs is a place like Marvin's.

547
00:34:59,600 --> 00:35:02,300
Marvin's Museum is a 5,000 square foot

548
00:35:02,301 --> 00:35:04,260
coin operated Twilight Zone.

549
00:35:05,960 --> 00:35:07,520
Packed with the strangest vintage

550
00:35:07,521 --> 00:35:11,020
and modern arcade amusements imaginable.

551
00:35:11,021 --> 00:35:15,400
