572
00:36:33,921 --> 00:36:36,680
Don't worry, try a little of this.

573
00:36:37,500 --> 00:36:40,220
Whoa, I love it.

574
00:36:40,460 --> 00:36:43,380
In the old days, there were some machines that did give you a shock.

575
00:36:45,340 --> 00:36:49,920
But of course, in today's litigious society, we can't have anything like that.

576
00:36:51,340 --> 00:36:56,900
Perhaps the weirdest of Marvin's attractions is aptly named Dr. Ralph Bingenpurge.

577
00:36:58,860 --> 00:37:00,440
Words fail me here.

578
00:37:00,940 --> 00:37:02,360
Just watch.

579
00:37:03,920 --> 00:37:17,920
That pretty much sums up why Marvin's Museum earned its runner-up spot on our countdown.

580
00:37:22,920 --> 00:37:28,080
Over the past hour, we've been weirding you out, counting down the top 10 oddest wonders

